0a0-e39ca31b0568" :question/math-academy-id "q-124181" :question/problem "If ${\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=8$ and ${\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=-3,$ calculate ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $y,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y-{\\int }_{-{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =-8-(-3) \\\\  & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-124181/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2fd19952-77af-5f27-a7ef-adf46b1958ae"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124181"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection/12b48b00f9c1ff14570ca66bc629787a88856efba1cda24cfb28da58c148801a" :answer/id #uuid "3cfe5bca-101d-5cd3-a466-35407eba8301" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "22" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "e5035d5e-5655-5ca3-8bb0-dcbe9c03b80b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection/aa4e4239377eb61b8bdf37e9f4374abeb3a1fdeaaf409dc6e37519ad01509799" :answer/id #uuid "d7a199a0-2eb6-5db1-89fa-2aab139b3a01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "25fb84d7-df97-52d5-9044-e02de8cb6f80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab" :answer/id #uuid "914dfaca-7316-5b2b-a2f1-8c9807bcb044" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "27" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f253d9bb-faac-51ac-8b6d-7592402df3fa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-124186/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-124186/selection/12b48b00f9c1ff14570ca66bc629787a88856efba1cda24cfb28da58c148801a" "q-124186/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-124186/selection/aa4e4239377eb61b8bdf37e9f4374abeb3a1fdeaaf409dc6e37519ad01509799" "q-124186/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-124186/selection/c9ec5d6cdf4e67c7f8bce68475bed400e56bf403f3d09b5928f78b6baa512eab"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-124186" :question/id #uuid "545af9f5-52f6-5277-ace0-011b4e386a69" :question/math-academy-id "q-124186" :question/problem "If ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=16$ and ${\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=11,$ calculate ${\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$ given that $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "Let $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ be a piecewise smooth path in the $xy$-plane, and let $-C$ be the curve consisting of the same points as $C$ but with the opposite orientation. \n\nFor line integrals with respect to $x,$ we have the following properties:\n\n- ${\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x$\n\nIn our case, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -{\\int }_{-C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & =-{\\int }_{-{C}_{1}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -16 & =-11+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -5 & ={\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x=-5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-124186/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2fd19952-77af-5f27-a7ef-adf46b1958ae"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124186"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection/27bfebb700f7a8d28e317d57b5581715730e68cbdf44b2e6b30d14fc5f88cf4c" :answer/id #uuid "65dbfb0d-e03f-5316-ad9e-7721e1dd3a58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\pi +2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "fd8a5cf2-72c5-53e9-8697-47e4e76697e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection/517c93c806130d93f64051da38e7fe980d6f1c6a93bc3de59c4ab469bab7323e" :answer/id #uuid "6deaa41d-8923-5dea-8480-3f5f5186b842" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi }{2}+2\\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "db938fef-5e65-5336-ae99-6761e76f3716" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "0b07e52e-f05f-5485-97a0-71c39afdcd20" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "38d6616b-52d6-5815-bfa1-9623657dd4ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-124341/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-124341/selection/27bfebb700f7a8d28e317d57b5581715730e68cbdf44b2e6b30d14fc5f88cf4c" "q-124341/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" "q-124341/selection/517c93c806130d93f64051da38e7fe980d6f1c6a93bc3de59c4ab469bab7323e" "q-124341/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-124341/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-124341" :question/id #uuid "c1f5fbac-def9-5884-ac36-5373ec03bd36" :question/math-academy-id "q-124341" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14066680/assets/1c074157bb6374a4da01d6c1312bb60520966317b1f903eb44a191384e398ae6.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ is the path comprising of a quarter circle of radius $3$ and a line segment, as shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{1}=1$ and ${y}_{2}=-4.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=(-4)-1=-5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-124341/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e6935944-0acd-5593-aa80-e56f6014c13f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124341"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-124346/selection/d0ab94490dee12664d2f70471811316d5faf74c9c