{∮}_{C}\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C$ is the closed path along a circle of radius $2,$ traversed once in the counterclockwise direction." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, the initial and terminal points are the same (since the path is closed and is traversed only once). Therefore, ${y}_{1}={y}_{2},$ and we have\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}\\,\\text{d}y=0.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-124346/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e6935944-0acd-5593-aa80-e56f6014c13f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-124346"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-124349/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "320947c0-d6b8-57b4-826d-bd19c58b0a19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124349/selection/18a69b5350f1153400581670f5e0496750d99f763ab218b64969217c69222f48" :answer/id #uuid "25f20c1a-1dfa-5a42-a327-c7ec733751c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3+\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124349/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "3fbfdf52-d0c9-5366-994b-9e03f7bae899" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124349/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "b81e4ed6-65da-5e9f-b550-f6b3bf043497" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-124349/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "e711272f-97